// The search field's placeholder: a different cow pun each time the launcher opens, picked for
// the time of day, the day of the week and the date. Pure Tish with no natives: main.tish passes
// in the local date and time (from expandTemplate's {date} and {time}, since Tish's Date is UTC)
// and a random number, and gets back the text.

